msgstr "Login Delay Shield"

#: wp-login-delay.php:277
msgid ""
"This plugin was formerly known as \"WP Login Delay\". The name has changed, "
"but all your settings have been preserved."
msgstr ""
"Plugin ini sebelumnya dikenal sebagai \"WP Login Delay\". Nama telah "
"berubah, tetapi semua pengaturan Anda telah dipertahankan."

